#: lib/hash-utility.c
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Multi-threaded file digest (hash) calculator.\n"
"\n"
"  Available digest types:\n"
"  Cryptographic:\n"
"    %s\n"
"\n"
"  Non-cryptographic:\n"
"    %s\n"
"\n"
"  Supported, but not useful:\n"
"    %s\n"
msgstr ""
"Multi-threaded berekening van bestands-digests (hashes).\n"
"\n"
"  Beschikbare digest-types:\n"
"  Cryptografisch:\n"
"    %s\n"
"\n"
"  Niet-cryptografisch:\n"
"    %s\n"
"\n"
"  Ondersteund, maar niet nuttig:\n"
"    %s\n"

